      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the suggestion. The problem is that input parameters have to be put before output parameters (go/cstyle#Inputs_and_Outputs). In this particular case, `allow_entry_not_found` is an input, so it has to come before `error_msg`, making it impossible to have a default argument. I could add an overload to work around this, but then we would essentially end up with two functions anyway. Therefore, I\u0027d rather have two variants because it looks cleaner.",
